[Tips.MovingMosaic_S]
effect.name=Mosaic effect that appears to move by sampling colors from random positions within each tile.
シード=Non-negative values generate different random for different objects even with the same seed.\nNegative values generate the same random for the same object with the same seed.
縦横比=Positive: vertically long / Negative: horizontally long
